{
    "title": "Safe Lagoon Parental Control",
    "description": "<b>Safe Lagoon - AI-Powered Parental Control & Block Apps on Android</b>\r\n\r\nProtect your children from online threats with Safe Lagoon, the award-winning AI-powered parental control app for Android. \r\n\r\nWhether it's setting parental blocks, managing screen time, or monitoring social media, Safe Lagoon helps safeguard your family from cyberbullying, online predators, and inappropriate content.\r\n\r\n<b>Why Choose Safe Lagoon?</b>\r\nSafe Lagoon combines advanced AI technology with robust parental controls, including Google parental controls, parental lock settings, and content filtering. \r\nCreate a secure environment on your child\u2019s Android device, so they can develop healthy digital habits while you enjoy peace of mind.\r\n\r\n<b>With Safe Lagoon:</b>\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udd12 AI-Enhanced Content Filtering:</b> Automatically block harmful websites and unblocked games to ensure your child\u2019s protection from online dangers. Safe Lagoon's parental filters provide a comprehensive block against unwanted content.\r\n<b>\ud83d\udcf5 Remote Monitoring:</b> Manage your child\u2019s device settings, block sites, and monitor apps like Kik, Telegram, and more\u2014even when you're not present. You\u2019ll stay in control with parental restrictions for Android.\r\n<b>\ud83d\udcf1 App Usage Control:</b>Set limits on games like Candy Crush and Talking Tom to help your child balance screen time with other activities, promoting healthier habits.\r\n<b>\ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f Screen Time Scheduling:</b> Establish screen time schedules to enforce limits and block access to specific apps or unblocked games during study or sleep time.\r\n<b>\ud83d\udccd Family Locator (Geofencing):</b> Use GPS tracking to monitor your child's location and receive instant alerts if they leave safe zones, perfect for busy parents needing a family locator.\r\n<b>\ud83d\udea8 Real-Time Alerts:</b>Get notifications about potential risks, breaches of parental settings, or attempts to bypass the parental block apps, keeping you informed at all times.\r\n<b>\ud83d\udd10 Secure Browsing:</b>Ensure a safe browsing experience with parental control on Google Chrome, blocking unwanted sites and applying strong parental protection against online threats.\r\n\r\n<b>Advanced Social Media Monitoring:</b>\r\nStay ahead of potential dangers by monitoring your child\u2019s activity on popular social media platforms:\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udcf1 TikTok, YouTube, and Instagram Monitoring:</b> Understand what your child is watching on TikTok and YouTube, and track interactions on Instagram. This helps protect them from harmful content, cyberbullying, and risky behavior.\r\n<b>\ud83d\udccb Screen Mirror:</b> With Safe Lagoon's Screen Mirror feature, view 100% of your child\u2019s texts and direct messages, even if deleted. This includes monitoring on apps like Kik, Telegram, and others\u2014ensuring nothing slips through the cracks.\r\n\r\n<b>How to Set Up Safe Lagoon:</b>\r\n1. Download the Safe Lagoon (Orange app) on your Android device and register your account.\r\n2. Install the Safe Lagoon companion app (Blue app) on your child\u2019s Android device.\r\n3. Follow the simple setup instructions to start managing kid's phone\r\n\r\n<b>Compatibility:</b>\r\nSafe Lagoon is fully compatible with Samsung Galaxy tablets and Android devices, providing comprehensive parental controls on Google platforms and more.\r\n\r\n<b>AI-Driven Monitoring:</b>\r\nWith AI, Safe Lagoon offers smarter monitoring that adapts to new online threats. \r\nStay informed with alerts about potential risks, and intervene before problems arise. From YouTube parental controls to managing online sexting risks on Kik or Telegram, Safe Lagoon provides you with all the tools you need.\r\n\r\nNote: Safe Lagoon requires Device Administrator and Accessibility permissions to enable parental controls on Android, including blocking apps, setting parental locks, and applying Google parental controls. Location data is collected to help parents track their child\u2019s device, even when the app is not in use. Safe Lagoon uploads Image information from the device to enable the remote Photo Gallery viewing feature for parents. \r\n\r\nFor more information, visit: https://safelagoon.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Safe Lagoon - AI-Powered Parental Control &amp; Block Apps on Android</b><br><br>Protect your children from online threats with Safe Lagoon, the award-winning AI-powered parental control app for Android. <br><br>Whether it&#39;s setting parental blocks, managing screen time, or monitoring social media, Safe Lagoon helps safeguard your family from cyberbullying, online predators, and inappropriate content.<br><br><b>Why Choose Safe Lagoon?</b><br>Safe Lagoon combines advanced AI technology with robust parental controls, including Google parental controls, parental lock settings, and content filtering. <br>Create a secure environment on your child\u2019s Android device, so they can develop healthy digital habits while you enjoy peace of mind.<br><br><b>With Safe Lagoon:</b><br><br><b>\ud83d\udd12 AI-Enhanced Content Filtering:</b> Automatically block harmful websites and unblocked games to ensure your child\u2019s protection from online dangers. Safe Lagoon&#39;s parental filters provide a comprehensive block against unwanted content.<br><b>\ud83d\udcf5 Remote Monitoring:</b> Manage your child\u2019s device settings, block sites, and monitor apps like Kik, Telegram, and more\u2014even when you&#39;re not present. You\u2019ll stay in control with parental restrictions for Android.<br><b>\ud83d\udcf1 App Usage Control:</b>Set limits on games like Candy Crush and Talking Tom to help your child balance screen time with other activities, promoting healthier habits.<br><b>\ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f Screen Time Scheduling:</b> Establish screen time schedules to enforce limits and block access to specific apps or unblocked games during study or sleep time.<br><b>\ud83d\udccd Family Locator (Geofencing):</b> Use GPS tracking to monitor your child&#39;s location and receive instant alerts if they leave safe zones, perfect for busy parents needing a family locator.<br><b>\ud83d\udea8 Real-Time Alerts:</b>Get notifications about potential risks, breaches of parental settings, or attempts to bypass the parental block apps, keeping you informed at all times.<br><b>\ud83d\udd10 Secure Browsing:</b>Ensure a safe browsing experience with parental control on Google Chrome, blocking unwanted sites and applying strong parental protection against online threats.<br><br><b>Advanced Social Media Monitoring:</b><br>Stay ahead of potential dangers by monitoring your child\u2019s activity on popular social media platforms:<br><br><b>\ud83d\udcf1 TikTok, YouTube, and Instagram Monitoring:</b> Understand what your child is watching on TikTok and YouTube, and track interactions on Instagram. This helps protect them from harmful content, cyberbullying, and risky behavior.<br><b>\ud83d\udccb Screen Mirror:</b> With Safe Lagoon&#39;s Screen Mirror feature, view 100% of your child\u2019s texts and direct messages, even if deleted. This includes monitoring on apps like Kik, Telegram, and others\u2014ensuring nothing slips through the cracks.<br><br><b>How to Set Up Safe Lagoon:</b><br>1. Download the Safe Lagoon (Orange app) on your Android device and register your account.<br>2. Install the Safe Lagoon companion app (Blue app) on your child\u2019s Android device.<br>3. Follow the simple setup instructions to start managing kid&#39;s phone<br><br><b>Compatibility:</b><br>Safe Lagoon is fully compatible with Samsung Galaxy tablets and Android devices, providing comprehensive parental controls on Google platforms and more.<br><br><b>AI-Driven Monitoring:</b><br>With AI, Safe Lagoon offers smarter monitoring that adapts to new online threats. <br>Stay informed with alerts about potential risks, and intervene before problems arise. From YouTube parental controls to managing online sexting risks on Kik or Telegram, Safe Lagoon provides you with all the tools you need.<br><br>Note: Safe Lagoon requires Device Administrator and Accessibility permissions to enable parental controls on Android, including blocking apps, setting parental locks, and applying Google parental controls. Location data is collected to help parents track their child\u2019s device, even when the app is not in use. Safe Lagoon uploads Image information from the device to enable the remote Photo Gallery viewing feature for parents. <br><br>For more information, visit: https://safelagoon.com",
